geoipupdate for Debian
----------------------

In order to use this package, edit /etc/GeoIP.conf or pass another
configuration file to geoipupdate using the -f flag. You need a MaxMind
account ID and license key; both are available from
https://www.maxmind.com/en/accounts/current/license-key.

The update runs daily, at a time randomized per machine: geoipupdate.timer on
systemd systems, /etc/cron.d/geoipupdate otherwise. Both stay inert until
/etc/GeoIP.conf holds a real account ID.

The databases are written to /usr/share/GeoIP.
